{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a giant robot against a horde of monsters in this co-op roguelike deckbuilder. Attempt each procedurally generated run alone or with a friend. Draw from and build up 2 decks at the same time, plan the sequence of each turn, and plug in the best mods. You'll need a big brain, or two, to prevent the invasion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1d4771916da98a2d03109010bb5ea03.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1d4771916da98a2d03109010bb5ea03.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1d4771916da98a2d03109010bb5ea03.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger than life monsters are invading the Earth! Play as a pair of scientists piloting the giant robot Super Supreme for the first time. Stronger together, you\u2019ll figure things out from the penthouse of a walking skyscraper. It\u2019s time to form <strong>Dream Team Supreme</strong> to save the day!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6a39e51f09b39cdf4d82fddddda95c35.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6a39e51f09b39cdf4d82fddddda95c35.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6a39e51f09b39cdf4d82fddddda95c35.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two heads are better than one. When the monsters put pressure on Super Supreme, talking through problems and ideas with a friend is more enjoyable. The camaraderie and team spirit uplift the whole experience. Working together on a combo feels like a giant robot high fiving itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6b8b5eff62f939d5d9cf7a56ed056beb.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6b8b5eff62f939d5d9cf7a56ed056beb.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6b8b5eff62f939d5d9cf7a56ed056beb.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beat sequence starts each turn as a blank canvas. Cleverly choose how to slot your cartridges into it, and program Super Supreme with the winning moves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and dual-sided cartridges make for different shaped puzzle pieces to solve the beat sequence with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing cartridges from 2 different decks provides ample synergies and fantastic power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/af1384dc1e6cc090474cbf360d99c6ad.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/af1384dc1e6cc090474cbf360d99c6ad.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/af1384dc1e6cc090474cbf360d99c6ad.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more hunting rats crawling through dark dungeons. Piloting Super Supreme feels like taking your favorite toy outside for an adventure in the sun. The horde of monsters of the week keep things light-hearted and wacky enough to feel like your imagination is running wild!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's the plan?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let players in on the fun of developing games</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop features and content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtest updates regularly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to player feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat 1, 2, 3 until we feel ready for release</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208500?t=1756846064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756846064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/cadf09fdca67e41ca8e144b36fec70802d0ba8f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756846064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/cadf09fdca67e41ca8e144b36fec70802d0ba8f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756846064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot a giant robot against a horde of monsters in this co-op roguelike deckbuilder. Attempt each procedurally generated run alone or with a friend. Draw from and build up 2 decks at the same time, plan the sequence of each turn, and plug in the best mods. You'll need a big brain, or two, to prevent the invasion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1d4771916da98a2d03109010bb5ea03.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1d4771916da98a2d03109010bb5ea03.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/c1d4771916da98a2d03109010bb5ea03.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Larger than life monsters are invading the Earth! Play as a pair of scientists piloting the giant robot Super Supreme for the first time. Stronger together, you\u2019ll figure things out from the penthouse of a walking skyscraper. It\u2019s time to form <strong>Dream Team Supreme</strong> to save the day!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6a39e51f09b39cdf4d82fddddda95c35.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6a39e51f09b39cdf4d82fddddda95c35.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6a39e51f09b39cdf4d82fddddda95c35.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two heads are better than one. When the monsters put pressure on Super Supreme, talking through problems and ideas with a friend is more enjoyable. The camaraderie and team spirit uplift the whole experience. Working together on a combo feels like a giant robot high fiving itself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6b8b5eff62f939d5d9cf7a56ed056beb.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6b8b5eff62f939d5d9cf7a56ed056beb.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/6b8b5eff62f939d5d9cf7a56ed056beb.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The beat sequence starts each turn as a blank canvas. Cleverly choose how to slot your cartridges into it, and program Super Supreme with the winning moves!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single and dual-sided cartridges make for different shaped puzzle pieces to solve the beat sequence with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawing cartridges from 2 different decks provides ample synergies and fantastic power.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/af1384dc1e6cc090474cbf360d99c6ad.poster.avif?t=1756846064\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/af1384dc1e6cc090474cbf360d99c6ad.webm?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/extras/af1384dc1e6cc090474cbf360d99c6ad.mp4?t=1756846064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more hunting rats crawling through dark dungeons. Piloting Super Supreme feels like taking your favorite toy outside for an adventure in the sun. The horde of monsters of the week keep things light-hearted and wacky enough to feel like your imagination is running wild!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What's the plan?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let players in on the fun of developing games</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop features and content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtest updates regularly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to player feedback</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat 1, 2, 3 until we feel ready for release</p></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["Big Adventure"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208500/header.jpg?t=1756846064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257178764,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178764/movie480.mp4?t=1754431358","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178764/movie_max.mp4?t=1754431358"},"name":"Co-op Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178764/2da140c302cb47eb3249538cdacb61f74278f4de/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754431358","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178764/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1754431358","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257178764/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1754431358"}}],"name":"Dream Team Supreme","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband